  "uuid": "1bbd6baf-50e1-4c74-a535-1821868df98f",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "dc15d0a9-3200-148c-2185-62e23eaf7cd3",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "c83a47c3-f270-f6d0-b3cc-4b426bc79cf6",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Dr Qidwai is a founding member of IFPCRN and has remained a Member of the Steering Committee till his recent selection as Vice-Chairman. He represented Middle East and South Asia region on the Steering Committee and promoted Primary Care Research in the region with setting up of research networks in Bangladesh , India , Sri Lanka and the UAE. Several research papers have come out of these initiatives.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Dr Qidwai has led a group of 37 IFPCRNs members that has written a paper on the present status and future role of family doctors. He earlier contributed in the writing of a paper on the role of family doctors in Primary Care Research, also written at the federation.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Dr Qidwai's selection as Vice-Chairman, International Federation of Primary Care Research Networks (IFPCRNs) is an honour for Pakistan as well as AKU.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
