    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr Waris Qidwai, Associate Professor, Department of Family Medicine, Aga Khan University (AKU) has been selected as the Vice-Chairman of International Federation of Primary Care Research Networks (IFPCRNs). The Federation is set up under the Task Force on Research of World Body of Family Doctors (WONCA). It has over 150 members from around the world and its mandate is to promote Primary Care Research around the globe.",
